+### 1245 — Compatibility Bridge Removes The Lockstep Outage Window
+- FINDING: task-board commit `063197b1` directly imports agents-management from 26 production and 38 test Go files across 13 public package families, but imports neither raw `pkg/plugin` nor `pkg/inferenceengine`; the dense surface is compatibility `agentic`/`vendorplugin` plus `providerlimits`.
+- EVIDENCE: A clean scratch task-board build pinned to public `skill-agents-management v0.5.0` passed the runnable spawn package tests, CLI build, authoritative board read, and real spawn-preflight; the only unskipped package failure required Git history absent from `git archive`.
+- DECISION: Release task-board `0.25.0` on the `v0.5.0` bridge before agents-infra `v1.7.0`; permit breaking agents-management `v0.6.0` only after both consumers ship and pass live spawn-and-route canaries.
